@1 = ~Don't you dare to steal anything. Last person that did ended up transported all the way to Caer Moray… NAKED! You do not want to share the same fate.~
@2 = ~What are you looking at. Move on!~
@3 = ~You're here to trade, not stare. I do not like being stared at. It'd be wise for you to keep that in mind.~
@4 = ~All these people make me anxious. Especially children. What is that strawberry cream-like liquid they smeared all over me!~
@5 = ~Are those Beholders?~
@6 = ~Oh, yes. Do not worry. They are harmless. Well, mostly. Let's say I... enhanced them with my powers, to ensure they scare away the thieves, whom I had in abundance here in the past. So far they do a decent job. Just don't play on their nerves. Last person who did, woke up hanging upside down from a lamp outside Elfsong with their skin recoloured to blue.~
